                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "234677656",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199139882415",
                            "num_reviews": 45,
                            "playtime_forever": 153,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 153,
                            "last_played": 1788760762
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I hate to give this game a negative review, because the actual racing part of the game is pretty good except for collision physics that makes vehicles stick together.  The main thing that brings this game down are the too frequent non-racing parts of the career mode, such as capture the flag, and modes where you have to race to capture randomly placed checkpoints, and a strange mode where you have to stay within a spotlight projected by a helicopter.  Who wants to play a career mode where you have fun half the time?  The positive points for this game are the incredibly quick load times, and the fact that a game released in 2012 still works perfectly fine on a modern day PC.  I did have some fun with this game, but that fun lasted about two hours before I got tired of the non-racing events.",
